Aristotelis Metaphysica — Jaeger's Greek edition (@greek-source-aristotle-critical: 0, is #book, #part-of @greek-scholarly-sources) { r_2MJF84NGSE83J9KWD3B8KBNPZ1
Aristotle. Aristotelis Metaphysica. Werner Jaeger, editor. Oxford Classical Texts, 1957. Greek text with critical apparatus. ISBN 9780198145134.

[Publisher and edition](https://global.oup.com/academic/product/aristotelis-metaphysica-9780198145134).

Use the actual text and apparatus for [the substance and explanation seminar](../research/seminars/Aristotle-substance.lingua#r_3B9A85Q4MC2K5NN4W1X1BQYEE5), alongside the identified translation. A textual decision and a philosophical interpretation can be related without being the same kind of argument.

For a project on another Aristotelian treatise, select and identify its corresponding critical edition before preparing the Greek dossier; this volume supplies Metaphysics.

**Access:** library or an owned edition. Record the edition used and its terms when obtaining a digital copy.
